    "先点起点神经元，再点终点神经元建立连接；Esc 取消当前连线。":
      "Click the source neuron, then the target neuron, to create a connection; Esc cancels.",
    "按左侧「放置坐标」面板的坐标落点，每放一个自动沿设定的轴步进一格，可连续放出一排或一面；Enter 等同于点「放置」；Shift+点击视口可拾取基准坐标；点到一个已经有神经元的位置 = 选中它，不会再多放一个。":
      "Neurons are dropped at the coordinates in the left panel and the next slot steps along the chosen axis, so you can lay a whole row or plane quickly; Enter does the same as Place; Shift+click the viewport to pick a base coordinate; clicking a spot that already has a neuron selects it instead of adding another.",
