    "连线粗细按权重（看主要连接）": "Link thickness by weight (spot the main links)",
    "神经元大小按连接强度（看重要神经元）": "Neuron size by connection strength (spot the hubs)",
    "数量 X": "Count X", "数量 Y": "Count Y", "数量 Z": "Count Z",
