    "铺设后按顺序连成链": "Chain them in order after filling",
    "h-bulk": "Quick fill uses the Step size above as spacing: a line = Count X neurons along X; a plane = Count X × Count Y; a cube = all three axes. The origin then moves past the block, so the next fill does not overlap.",
    "最多播放波数": "Max waves to play",
    "h-simlimit": "0 = no limit. Waves are counted from the first wave that actually lights a neuron; empty waves do not count. On a big model use 10-30: lighting hundreds of thousands of neurons at once will bog the machine down. At the limit it stops, and everything already lit still pulses in order.",
