    "只连单向（按层号递增，避免成环）": "One-way only (increasing wave index, keeps it acyclic)",
    "按距离随机连接": "Random link by distance",
    "分层轴": "Layer axis",
    "层厚度": "Layer thickness",
    "每层连几个": "Links per neuron",
    "层间距离上限": "Max link distance",
    "按轴分层连接": "Link layer by layer",
    "按轴串联成链": "Chain along axis",
    "删除选中神经元之间的连接": "Delete links among selected",
    "批量连接只会「加边」，已有的边一条不动，重复的自动跳过。因为要两两比较，一次最多处理 4000 个神经元，更多请分批框选。「按距离随机连接」在最大距离内随机挑最近的几个，每次点出来都不一样；「按轴分层连接」沿所选轴按「层厚度」分桶，每个神经元只连下一层最近的几个，就是常见的前馈连法；「按轴串联成链」沿轴排序后相邻相连，永远是一条链。勾了「只连单向」时按 (层号, 编号) 的字典序判方向，保证不会成环。":
      "Batch link only adds edges; existing edges are untouched and duplicates are skipped. It compares every pair, so it caps the selection at 4000 neurons - box-select in batches beyond that. Random-by-distance picks near neighbours with a random jitter, so each press gives a different wiring. Layer-by-layer buckets the selection along the chosen axis (bucket width = layer thickness) and only links each neuron to the nearest few in the next bucket, which is the usual feed-forward pattern. Chain-along-axis sorts along the axis and links neighbours, which is always a chain. With one-way checked the direction follows the (wave index, index) order, which guarantees an acyclic graph.",

