    "参数不进 .py，编译后按声明类型写进 model.bin：浮点进 float32 段、整型与索引进 int32 段。板子的贴图取的是元素最多的那一个（这里标了「贴图」）。": "Parameters do not go into the .py; at compile time they are written into model.bin by declared type — floats into the float32 section, integers and indices into the int32 section. The plate’s texture uses the largest tensor (marked “Texture” here).",
